WEBVTT

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:02.330
Hi, this is Crophalo.

00:00:03.300 --> 00:00:04.400
Pick your field on the map.

00:00:08.100 --> 00:00:11.750
Answer four short questions about your crops, your water and your soil.

00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:17.510
Crophalo reads your field's own NASA weather record, back to 2001,

00:00:17.860 --> 00:00:20.110
and shows which rotation suits it, and why.

00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:22.670
It's a guide. You decide what to plant.

00:00:23.200 --> 00:00:25.980
Keep the field in My Farm, and compare the plans on your map.

00:00:26.900 --> 00:00:29.770
Crophalo. Know your field before you plant.
